<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 59 FOR FOUR AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 59 FOR FOUR AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 59 for four at lunch on the first day of the fifth and final test match against the West Indies at the WACA Ground on Saturday.</p>
<p>Score - Australia 59 for four in 28 overs.</p>
</text>
